1
00:01:33,110 --> 00:01:38,220
[First Love Again]

2
00:01:38,360 --> 00:01:40,920
[Episode 24]

3
00:01:41,110 --> 00:01:42,000
I can continue.

4
00:01:42,710 --> 00:01:43,229
Are you sure?

5
00:01:43,229 --> 00:01:44,000
I'm sure.

6
00:01:45,759 --> 00:01:46,350
Okay.

7
00:01:50,479 --> 00:01:51,970
[You're the best! You got this!]

8
00:01:55,870 --> 00:01:57,789
After all, the deficit was still
more than ten points.

9
00:01:57,789 --> 00:01:59,020
Gu Han didn't stay off the court for long

10
00:01:59,020 --> 00:02:00,680
before returning to the game.

11
00:02:01,790 --> 00:02:02,380
Come on!

12
00:02:02,710 --> 00:02:03,990
Go, Gu Han!

13
00:02:04,790 --> 00:02:06,040
Go, Gu Han!

14
00:02:05,750 --> 00:02:06,150
[JCU 46—ZHU 66]

15
00:02:06,040 --> 00:02:07,320
Go, Gu Han!

16
00:02:06,170 --> 00:02:07,220
[JCU 58—ZHU 66]

17
00:02:07,820 --> 00:02:10,419
-Gu Han drives to the basket.
-Come on! Come on!

18
00:02:10,590 --> 00:02:11,630
Wang Zihao guards Gu Han.

19
00:02:10,720 --> 00:02:12,110
[JCU 58—ZHU 66]

20
00:02:11,630 --> 00:02:12,430
Mark him!

21
00:02:13,040 --> 00:02:14,200
Play defense!

22
00:02:15,870 --> 00:02:16,890
Come on, come on!

23
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:17,680
Defense!

24
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:20,030
Stop him!

25
00:02:20,870 --> 00:02:22,530
He just blew right past Gu Han.

26
00:02:24,650 --> 00:02:25,829
Nice play!

27
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:28,630
Gu Han is clearly playing
through the pain.

28
00:02:28,630 --> 00:02:30,280
Otherwise, he wouldn't have
let Wang Zihao get past that easily.

29
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:31,710
-Who knows how much longer he can hold on?
-Captain,

30
00:02:31,710 --> 00:02:32,840
want me to help defend him?

31
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:33,840
Captain, why don't you play the four?

32
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:35,140
I'm fine. I'm fine. I can do this.

33
00:02:35,140 --> 00:02:35,730
Come on.

34
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:37,310
Come on, get back on defense!

35
00:02:37,310 --> 00:02:39,170
Captain, I'll help you next time.

36
00:02:40,470 --> 00:02:41,310
The shouts

37
00:02:41,310 --> 00:02:43,520
of every JCU player rang
across the court.

38
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:44,920
Their message was clear:

39
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:46,820
they were urging Gu Han
to play power forward,

40
00:02:46,820 --> 00:02:48,150
where he'd face less defensive pressure.

41
00:02:48,150 --> 00:02:49,010
Mark him! Mark him!

42
00:02:49,010 --> 00:02:50,800
That way, he could
save his energy for offense.

43
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:51,400
Stop him!

44
00:02:51,420 --> 00:02:52,130
But that meant

45
00:02:52,130 --> 00:02:54,620
the others might not
have the stamina to keep it up for long.

46
00:02:54,620 --> 00:02:58,020
They could even end up
defending five players with only four.

47
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:01,380
Stay composed!

48
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:04,670
-Watch Wang Zihao!
-Pass to Wang Zihao in the corner.

49
00:03:04,670 --> 00:03:05,870
He shakes off Chen Yu.

50
00:03:07,130 --> 00:03:08,460
Gu Han shoots.

51
00:03:11,250 --> 00:03:12,150
It's in! What a shot!

52
00:03:12,150 --> 00:03:12,780
Go!

53
00:03:13,630 --> 00:03:14,880
What a shot!

54
00:03:15,190 --> 00:03:16,730
-But JCU gave it their all.
-You okay?

55
00:03:16,730 --> 00:03:19,460
Wang Zihao really came through
when it mattered.

56
00:03:20,690 --> 00:03:21,370
Coach,

57
00:03:23,630 --> 00:03:24,560
can I go in?

58
00:03:26,430 --> 00:03:27,320
[Substitution]

59
00:03:26,720 --> 00:03:27,450
Substitution!

60
00:03:27,450 --> 00:03:28,570
[JCU 62—ZHU 70]

61
00:03:33,550 --> 00:03:34,760
-Sirui.
-Sirui.

62
00:03:35,079 --> 00:03:35,870
Sirui.

63
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:45,810
Sirui's back.

64
00:03:45,950 --> 00:03:48,110
Coach, I want to stay on the court.

65
00:03:52,380 --> 00:03:53,980
Wang Hao, you're coming off.

66
00:03:55,440 --> 00:03:56,720
I believe in all of you.

67
00:03:56,750 --> 00:03:58,070
Help each other out

68
00:03:58,090 --> 00:03:59,150
and share the load.

69
00:04:00,140 --> 00:04:01,240
You can do this.

70
00:04:03,260 --> 00:04:03,870
Come on.

71
00:04:10,010 --> 00:04:11,290
One, two, three!

72
00:04:11,310 --> 00:04:12,720
-JCU!
-Go!

73
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:20,920
Gu Han!

74
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,750
Go, Gu Han!

75
00:04:22,750 --> 00:04:24,160
Gu Han! Gu Han!

76
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:25,600
Go, JCU!

77
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:26,360
Whatever

78
00:04:26,380 --> 00:04:27,360
-kept him...
-Come on, son.

79
00:04:27,360 --> 00:04:28,480
Out before,

80
00:04:28,530 --> 00:04:29,910
Li Sirui's return couldn't

81
00:04:29,910 --> 00:04:31,610
-have come at a better time.
-Mark him!

82
00:04:31,610 --> 00:04:32,520
With Sirui back,

83
00:04:32,520 --> 00:04:34,590
JCU now has a second ball handler.

84
00:04:34,610 --> 00:04:36,220
Finally, someone else can take

85
00:04:36,220 --> 00:04:38,110
some of the pressure
off Gu Han on offense.

86
00:04:36,510 --> 00:04:37,440
[Keep Striving, Keep the Youth Alive]

87
00:04:38,870 --> 00:04:40,270
Li Sirui's playing tough!

88
00:04:40,270 --> 00:04:40,770
Get back on defense!

89
00:04:40,740 --> 00:04:42,040
[JCU 64—ZHU 70]

90
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:43,380
He seems a lot less
afraid of physical contact now.

91
00:04:43,380 --> 00:04:44,510
Get back on defense!

92
00:04:45,270 --> 00:04:46,000
You're here.

93
00:04:46,070 --> 00:04:46,870
Who's ahead?

94
00:04:46,870 --> 00:04:47,800
How's the score?

95
00:04:47,870 --> 00:04:49,159
We're still behind.

96
00:04:49,190 --> 00:04:50,310
Get in position!

97
00:04:50,310 --> 00:04:52,040
Don't leave the baseline open!

98
00:04:54,780 --> 00:04:55,780
Nice!

99
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:59,090
Li Sirui's return
and Gu Han's determination

100
00:04:59,090 --> 00:05:01,010
have clearly
given JCU a huge morale boost.

101
00:05:01,010 --> 00:05:02,630
Zhou Yunze and Kong Fang
score back-to-back,

102
00:05:02,630 --> 00:05:04,240
closing the gap
between the two teams.

103
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:06,310
Chen Yu! Chen Yu!

104
00:05:06,830 --> 00:05:07,680
Nice!

105
00:05:07,700 --> 00:05:08,330
Good!

106
00:05:08,790 --> 00:05:09,880
[JCU 71—ZHU 75]

107
00:05:08,830 --> 00:05:09,240
Great play!

108
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:10,040
Kong Fang!

109
00:05:10,060 --> 00:05:12,310
Gu Han brings the ball up
and sets up the offense.

110
00:05:12,310 --> 00:05:13,870
JCU is now down by just four.

111
00:05:13,780 --> 00:05:15,070
[JCU 71—ZHU 75]

112
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:17,250
The ball comes back to Gu Han.

113
00:05:17,250 --> 00:05:18,220
He shoots.

114
00:05:18,310 --> 00:05:19,270
It's in!

115
00:05:22,540 --> 00:05:23,830
Nice! Nice!

116
00:05:23,330 --> 00:05:24,460
[JCU 73—ZHU 75]

117
00:05:25,750 --> 00:05:26,950
Stay calm! Stay calm!

118
00:05:28,610 --> 00:05:30,370
Watch the clock!

119
00:05:31,660 --> 00:05:31,900
[0:20]

120
00:05:31,900 --> 00:05:32,470
[0:19]

121
00:05:32,830 --> 00:05:33,800
Time's running out!

122
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:34,800
Mark Gu Han!

123
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:35,600
Pass it!

124
00:05:40,710 --> 00:05:43,110
One last possession, everyone! Keep it up!

125
00:05:43,310 --> 00:05:44,260
Hurry! Hurry!

126
00:05:44,290 --> 00:05:45,750
Just 15 seconds left,

127
00:05:45,950 --> 00:05:46,920
and the game is down
to a two-point difference.

128
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:47,920
Hurry! Hurry!

129
00:05:47,030 --> 00:05:49,170
♪ A meeting clear as dew ♪

130
00:05:49,620 --> 00:05:51,780
♪ Embracing the warm wind
of a summer night ♪

131
00:05:49,750 --> 00:05:50,550
Hurry! Hurry!

132
00:05:50,570 --> 00:05:51,630
Gu Han has the ball.

133
00:05:51,950 --> 00:05:53,530
Is he going to take it himself?

134
00:05:52,100 --> 00:05:55,540
♪ The rhythm of the hoops
echoes through the court ♪

135
00:05:53,570 --> 00:05:55,290
Let's see what JCU does here.

136
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:58,040
Will they pull off a game-winner
or suffer a heartbreaking loss?

137
00:05:57,290 --> 00:05:58,890
♪ Remembering the dreams
that brought us together ♪

138
00:05:58,310 --> 00:05:59,070
Li Sirui!

139
00:05:59,090 --> 00:06:00,700
Li Sirui's looking for an opening.

140
00:05:59,390 --> 00:06:01,620
♪ Young hearts ablaze with passion ♪

141
00:06:00,770 --> 00:06:01,290
He's getting into position!

142
00:06:01,290 --> 00:06:02,010
Stop him!

143
00:06:02,270 --> 00:06:02,680
Stop him!

144
00:06:02,320 --> 00:06:05,770
♪ Protecting the fire
burning deep inside ♪

145
00:06:02,680 --> 00:06:03,630
It's about time to shoot.

146
00:06:03,630 --> 00:06:04,390
Pass me the ball!

147
00:06:04,390 --> 00:06:05,390
Hold your ground!

148
00:06:05,430 --> 00:06:06,160
Mark him!

149
00:06:06,850 --> 00:06:08,200
Li Sirui gets the ball!

150
00:06:06,950 --> 00:06:10,620
♪ Regardless of what lies ahead ♪

151
00:06:08,630 --> 00:06:09,540
What a play!

152
00:06:09,090 --> 00:06:09,290
[9:14]

153
00:06:09,290 --> 00:06:09,740
[9:13]

154
00:06:10,430 --> 00:06:11,190
He shoots!

155
00:06:11,240 --> 00:06:15,360
♪ We set sail on a long
and winding journey ♪

156
00:06:16,700 --> 00:06:21,340
♪ Beyond the raging waves ♪

157
00:06:22,030 --> 00:06:26,280
♪ We embrace our own universe ♪

158
00:06:23,540 --> 00:06:24,030
[0:02]

159
00:06:24,050 --> 00:06:24,270
[0:01]

160
00:06:26,080 --> 00:06:27,560
It's in!

161
00:06:26,410 --> 00:06:26,620
[JCU 73—ZHU 75]

162
00:06:26,640 --> 00:06:27,260
[JCU 76—ZHU 75]

163
00:06:26,970 --> 00:06:30,470
♪ Rush despite the fierce wind and rain ♪

164
00:06:27,580 --> 00:06:29,900
Li Sirui wins it at the buzzer!

165
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:31,630
What a hard-fought win!

166
00:06:30,700 --> 00:06:33,260
♪ Be as free as the wind ♪

167
00:06:31,750 --> 00:06:33,750
Congratulations to Jiangcheng University
on reclaiming

168
00:06:33,400 --> 00:06:36,500
♪ Dreams will break the end of the world ♪

169
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:36,950
the college league championship
for the first time in eight years!

170
00:06:36,950 --> 00:06:39,140
They've truly risen from the ashes!

171
00:06:36,990 --> 00:06:40,659
♪ The power of light
encompasses the universe ♪

172
00:06:39,210 --> 00:06:41,750
Congratulations, JCU Team!

173
00:06:40,900 --> 00:06:43,010
♪ Even if we
go against the ocean currents ♪

174
00:06:43,030 --> 00:06:47,090
♪ We'll still
cut through the sky with our arms ♪

175
00:06:47,150 --> 00:06:50,530
♪ Rush despite the fierce wind and rain ♪

176
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:48,480
Son!

177
00:06:48,480 --> 00:06:50,090
JCU! JCU! JCU!

178
00:06:50,110 --> 00:06:52,600
JCU! JCU! JCU!

179
00:06:50,710 --> 00:06:53,560
♪ Be as free as the wind ♪

180
00:06:53,580 --> 00:06:56,970
♪ Dreams will break the end of the world ♪

181
00:06:57,090 --> 00:07:00,540
♪ The power of light
encompasses the universe ♪

182
00:07:00,860 --> 00:07:03,420
♪ Even if we
go against the ocean currents ♪

183
00:07:01,120 --> 00:07:02,800
We're the best!

184
00:07:03,460 --> 00:07:08,100
♪ We'll still
cut through the sky with our arms ♪

185
00:07:30,580 --> 00:07:36,350
♪ Whose heart is beating so fast? ♪

186
00:07:36,490 --> 00:07:40,230
♪ I'm trying to probe into her feelings ♪

187
00:07:40,590 --> 00:07:44,220
♪ When our eyes meet, I know deep inside ♪

188
00:07:44,370 --> 00:07:50,170
♪ Just like sparrows bickering ♪

189
00:07:50,200 --> 00:07:53,800
♪ It's caused by the emotions ♪

190
00:07:53,830 --> 00:07:57,940
♪ But our tacit understanding
is doubled secretly ♪

191
00:07:57,960 --> 00:08:00,430
♪ What happened? ♪

192
00:08:00,790 --> 00:08:07,780
♪ It seemed like destiny,
but it only backfired ♪

193
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:11,550
♪ The more we separate,
the closer we'll get ♪

194
00:08:11,670 --> 00:08:15,140
♪ And the more fiercely
my heart will beat ♪

195
00:08:12,710 --> 00:08:15,140
Kiss! Kiss! Kiss!

196
00:08:15,170 --> 00:08:17,910
Kiss! Kiss! Kiss!

197
00:08:15,230 --> 00:08:19,040
♪ A gentle breeze sweeps
across the starry sky ♪

198
00:08:19,770 --> 00:08:22,860
♪ The stars embrace the breeze ♪

199
00:08:22,980 --> 00:08:27,100
♪ Remember the dreams we chased together ♪

200
00:08:27,370 --> 00:08:28,900
♪ Fearlessly holding on
to what we believe ♪

201
00:08:29,050 --> 00:08:33,580
♪ Through every twist
and turn of our story ♪

202
00:08:33,620 --> 00:08:38,080
♪ Our eyes are filled
with the happiest tales to tell ♪

203
00:08:37,860 --> 00:08:40,330
[JCU 76—ZHU 75]

204
00:08:38,380 --> 00:08:42,710
♪ Love is like two hearts intertwined ♪

205
00:08:44,330 --> 00:08:47,450
♪ Binding you and me together ♪

206
00:08:56,410 --> 00:09:00,260
[One month later]

207
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:02,750
Slow down, slow down.

208
00:09:02,750 --> 00:09:03,330
Slower?

209
00:09:03,350 --> 00:09:03,990
Easy.

210
00:09:04,470 --> 00:09:05,280
Is this okay?

211
00:09:05,310 --> 00:09:06,310
Easy, easy, easy.

212
00:09:07,150 --> 00:09:07,990
Is that okay?

213
00:09:09,300 --> 00:09:10,110
Be gentle.

214
00:09:11,150 --> 00:09:11,550
Ow, ow, ow!

215
00:09:11,550 --> 00:09:12,210
Ow, ow, ow!

216
00:09:14,830 --> 00:09:16,030
Is this okay?

217
00:09:17,390 --> 00:09:18,390
-Easy.
-Captain.

218
00:09:18,700 --> 00:09:20,080
Um, congratulations
on getting discharged.

219
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:20,780
Don't mind us. Carry on.

220
00:09:20,780 --> 00:09:21,410
Sorry to interrupt!

221
00:09:21,410 --> 00:09:22,690
Let's go, let's go!

222
00:09:24,160 --> 00:09:25,040
What?

223
00:09:29,150 --> 00:09:31,210
Are you really driving me home later?

224
00:09:31,530 --> 00:09:32,700
Why wouldn't I?

225
00:09:32,730 --> 00:09:33,860
I'm a great driver.

226
00:09:34,810 --> 00:09:36,270
Why don't we just get a cab?

227
00:09:37,180 --> 00:09:37,750
No.

228
00:09:37,770 --> 00:09:38,350
Wait, wait...

229
00:09:38,350 --> 00:09:38,830
Wait, wait...

230
00:09:38,830 --> 00:09:39,370
Easy, easy...

231
00:09:39,370 --> 00:09:40,060
Easy, easy...

232
00:09:40,060 --> 00:09:40,730
Slow down.

233
00:09:41,750 --> 00:09:42,800
Is this okay?

234
00:09:43,500 --> 00:09:44,930
-No, no, no.
-Get down first.

235
00:09:44,930 --> 00:09:45,620
Get down.

236
00:09:49,140 --> 00:09:50,200
What are you doing?

237
00:09:51,570 --> 00:09:52,370
Give me a hand!

238
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:56,050
Coming, coming!

239
00:10:03,640 --> 00:10:04,250
So?

240
00:10:04,930 --> 00:10:06,610
How's my driving?

241
00:10:06,730 --> 00:10:07,460
Pretty good.

242
00:10:11,370 --> 00:10:12,970
Why do you keep looking at me?

243
00:10:13,910 --> 00:10:14,750
You seem

244
00:10:15,200 --> 00:10:16,330
to have lost weight.

245
00:10:17,700 --> 00:10:19,790
You stayed by my side
the whole time I was having surgery.

246
00:10:19,790 --> 00:10:21,390
It must've been exhausting.

247
00:10:22,850 --> 00:10:24,050
It's no big deal.

248
00:10:24,080 --> 00:10:25,940
Isn't losing weight a good thing?

249
00:10:26,350 --> 00:10:27,750
What about you, though?

250
00:10:27,860 --> 00:10:29,030
The doctor said

251
00:10:29,050 --> 00:10:31,180
if you hadn't pushed yourself
so hard in the final,

252
00:10:31,180 --> 00:10:33,440
you might not have needed surgery at all.

253
00:10:35,110 --> 00:10:36,070
Then I guess

254
00:10:36,340 --> 00:10:37,670
I got pretty lucky, huh?

255
00:10:38,170 --> 00:10:39,460
We won the championship,

256
00:10:39,460 --> 00:10:41,390
and my patellar tendon didn't rupture.

257
00:10:41,390 --> 00:10:42,440
And

258
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:44,240
most importantly...

259
00:10:46,100 --> 00:10:46,740
What?

260
00:10:48,150 --> 00:10:49,150
You've been

261
00:10:49,690 --> 00:10:51,090
by my side the whole time.

262
00:10:57,210 --> 00:10:58,140
Eyes on the road.

263
00:11:09,750 --> 00:11:10,880
I got it, I got it!

264
00:11:12,270 --> 00:11:13,560
The surgery went very well.

265
00:11:13,560 --> 00:11:14,530
The doctor said

266
00:11:14,560 --> 00:11:16,230
that if he makes a good recovery,

267
00:11:16,230 --> 00:11:17,080
it shouldn't affect his life

268
00:11:17,080 --> 00:11:18,360
going forward.

269
00:11:18,420 --> 00:11:19,440
So don't worry.

270
00:11:19,190 --> 00:11:20,950
[Switch] [Switch to voice call]

271
00:11:19,560 --> 00:11:21,190
Get plenty of rest, okay?

272
00:11:21,210 --> 00:11:21,810
I will.

273
00:11:22,490 --> 00:11:24,100
You're a basketball player.

274
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:27,590
[Switch] [Switch to voice call]

275
00:11:24,540 --> 00:11:26,010
Without your health,

276
00:11:26,040 --> 00:11:28,570
how can you keep pursuing the career
you love?

277
00:11:28,610 --> 00:11:30,920
Auntie, does that mean

278
00:11:31,370 --> 00:11:32,790
Gu Han can keep playing basketball

279
00:11:32,790 --> 00:11:34,240
instead of going abroad to study finance?

280
00:11:34,210 --> 00:11:35,850
[Switch] [Switch to voice call]

281
00:11:39,770 --> 00:11:41,120
[Switch] [Switch to voice call]

282
00:11:45,070 --> 00:11:46,670
What are you thinking about?

283
00:11:47,540 --> 00:11:49,200
I just never expected my mom to

284
00:11:49,640 --> 00:11:51,660
agree to let me keep playing basketball

285
00:11:51,660 --> 00:11:53,520
after watching me play that game.

286
00:11:54,760 --> 00:11:56,550
Seeing her son

287
00:11:56,580 --> 00:11:58,170
fight so hard for his dream
with her own eyes

288
00:11:58,170 --> 00:11:59,660
must have felt different.

289
00:12:03,980 --> 00:12:05,140
I never expected her

290
00:12:05,520 --> 00:12:07,850
to understand me,
nor did I hope she would.

291
00:12:08,270 --> 00:12:10,320
If I'd been able to communicate

292
00:12:10,650 --> 00:12:12,290
with her as well as you do,

293
00:12:12,710 --> 00:12:15,370
maybe things wouldn't
have turned out this way.

294
00:12:17,940 --> 00:12:18,670
Xiangxiang,

295
00:12:19,950 --> 00:12:20,620
thank you.

296
00:12:22,870 --> 00:12:24,800
Why are you being so formal with me?

297
00:12:26,010 --> 00:12:27,230
You just got out of the hospital.

298
00:12:27,230 --> 00:12:29,280
Why insist on coming all the way out here?

299
00:12:29,280 --> 00:12:31,450
I'd been cooped up in the hospital
for so long. I was dying to get out.

300
00:12:31,450 --> 00:12:33,960
Is it too much to ask
for something good to eat?

301
00:12:33,960 --> 00:12:35,150
Fair enough.

302
00:12:35,170 --> 00:12:36,630
So, what do you want to eat?

303
00:12:37,030 --> 00:12:38,220
I want...

304
00:12:40,400 --> 00:12:42,060
mashed potatoes with wasabi.

305
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:44,530
All right, let's go.

306
00:12:47,620 --> 00:12:48,230
Liu,

307
00:12:48,920 --> 00:12:49,920
here's the thing.

308
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:52,760
Something urgent has come up,

309
00:12:52,950 --> 00:12:54,790
and I was wondering
if I could borrow some money from you.

310
00:12:54,790 --> 00:12:56,120
Would that be possible?

311
00:12:58,160 --> 00:12:59,390
Oh, you just bought a house.

312
00:12:59,390 --> 00:13:01,670
You deliberately skipped an assignment
the company gave you

313
00:13:01,670 --> 00:13:03,600
to compete in another tournament.

314
00:13:03,930 --> 00:13:06,790
Do you realize that's a serious
breach of contract?

315
00:13:08,740 --> 00:13:10,140
Is now a good time to talk?

316
00:13:10,540 --> 00:13:12,710
I know, I really need the money.

317
00:13:13,840 --> 00:13:15,040
It's fine, it's fine.

318
00:13:15,120 --> 00:13:17,520
You know why I signed you
in the first place?

319
00:13:18,090 --> 00:13:20,300
Because you're Gu Han's good friend.

320
00:13:20,500 --> 00:13:21,100
Bin,

321
00:13:21,910 --> 00:13:22,640
are you busy?

322
00:13:22,790 --> 00:13:24,690
I was hoping to borrow 10,000 yuan
from you.

323
00:13:24,690 --> 00:13:25,900
If that's too much,

324
00:13:25,930 --> 00:13:27,190
even 5,000 would help.

325
00:13:31,750 --> 00:13:32,360
Okay.

326
00:13:34,970 --> 00:13:36,700
Let's terminate the contract.

327
00:13:36,800 --> 00:13:37,400
Sure.

328
00:13:38,090 --> 00:13:39,690
The penalty is 200,000 yuan.

329
00:13:40,990 --> 00:13:43,190
You're free to leave whenever you want.

330
00:13:52,590 --> 00:13:56,300
[IOU] [Student Loan] [Personal Loan]

331
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:06,700
I was passing by,
so I thought I'd drop in.

332
00:14:07,690 --> 00:14:08,290
Come in.

333
00:14:11,400 --> 00:14:13,060
No need to take your shoes off.

334
00:14:31,240 --> 00:14:31,900
Have a seat.

335
00:14:36,160 --> 00:14:36,850
Sorry

336
00:14:38,350 --> 00:14:39,210
about the mess.

337
00:14:48,360 --> 00:14:49,330
You know,

338
00:14:49,360 --> 00:14:51,000
that three-pointer you hit to win
the game

339
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:52,400
is all over the internet.

340
00:14:52,910 --> 00:14:54,120
Some people are even saying

341
00:14:54,120 --> 00:14:55,600
you saved JCU Team.

342
00:14:57,990 --> 00:15:01,850
I haven't had this much fun
playing basketball in a long time, either.

343
00:15:05,670 --> 00:15:06,570
So, how did things go

344
00:15:06,570 --> 00:15:09,380
with Bai Xue?
Did she give you a hard time?

345
00:15:11,500 --> 00:15:12,240
No,

346
00:15:12,830 --> 00:15:13,960
it's all sorted out.

347
00:15:37,790 --> 00:15:39,250
I'm going to the bathroom.

348
00:15:52,820 --> 00:15:53,420
Hello.

349
00:15:55,050 --> 00:15:55,650
Hello.

350
00:15:57,950 --> 00:15:58,550
Yes,

351
00:15:59,270 --> 00:16:00,670
I'd like to take out a loan

352
00:16:03,600 --> 00:16:04,600
for 200,000 yuan.

353
00:16:05,500 --> 00:16:07,160
Do I have to put up collateral?

354
00:16:09,320 --> 00:16:11,150
Okay, I'll think about it.

355
00:16:12,030 --> 00:16:12,630
Thank you.

356
00:16:34,440 --> 00:16:36,230
Maybe I should talk to my dad after all.

357
00:16:36,230 --> 00:16:36,940
No.

358
00:16:37,080 --> 00:16:37,930
What's wrong?

359
00:16:40,910 --> 00:16:42,240
I don't want him to know.

360
00:16:45,210 --> 00:16:46,670
I'll take responsibility

361
00:16:46,930 --> 00:16:47,990
for my own choices.

362
00:16:49,520 --> 00:16:51,580
Even if I have to pick up some odd jobs,

363
00:16:52,390 --> 00:16:54,520
I'll pay back the 200,000 yuan in full.

364
00:16:58,040 --> 00:16:58,850
Don't worry.

365
00:16:59,530 --> 00:17:00,810
I'm not a kid anymore.

366
00:17:01,050 --> 00:17:02,580
I'll make sure I pay it back.

367
00:17:04,440 --> 00:17:05,130
But

368
00:17:05,869 --> 00:17:07,930
please don't tell anyone about this,

369
00:17:08,270 --> 00:17:08,880
okay?

370
00:17:28,569 --> 00:17:30,120
I was partly responsible

371
00:17:30,140 --> 00:17:31,810
for encouraging you to make this choice,

372
00:17:31,810 --> 00:17:32,620
wasn't I?

373
00:17:53,850 --> 00:17:55,450
Xiaotao, what are you doing?

374
00:17:55,690 --> 00:17:56,460
Nothing.

375
00:17:57,490 --> 00:17:58,490
What about you?

376
00:18:00,270 --> 00:18:01,310
Our production team is making a show

377
00:18:01,310 --> 00:18:03,440
about basketball culture in China,

378
00:18:01,460 --> 00:18:03,280
[No Staying Up Late]

379
00:18:04,150 --> 00:18:04,990
so

380
00:18:05,510 --> 00:18:07,510
everyone has to come up with a topic.

381
00:18:08,750 --> 00:18:10,110
Well, take your time thinking it over.

382
00:18:10,110 --> 00:18:11,770
I won't bother you any longer.

383
00:18:12,780 --> 00:18:14,360
[No Staying Up Late]

384
00:18:44,430 --> 00:18:45,540
What are you doing?

385
00:18:49,100 --> 00:18:51,370
Nothing. Just tidying up a bit.

386
00:18:54,510 --> 00:18:56,400
Are you trying to clear
out the whole place?

387
00:18:56,400 --> 00:18:57,530
You think I'm blind?

388
00:18:59,110 --> 00:18:59,720
I...

389
00:19:05,750 --> 00:19:07,440
He hasn't told his parents, either,

390
00:19:07,440 --> 00:19:09,660
and he won't let Xiaotao
ask her parents for money.

391
00:19:09,660 --> 00:19:11,520
He insists on earning it himself.

392
00:19:12,880 --> 00:19:13,790
I get that.

393
00:19:13,900 --> 00:19:17,070
If it were me, I wouldn't want
to trouble my family, either.

394
00:19:17,070 --> 00:19:17,750
Captain,

395
00:19:17,810 --> 00:19:20,730
Sirui only did this
for the sake of the team.

396
00:19:21,610 --> 00:19:22,970
I'll chip in 10,000 yuan.

397
00:19:22,970 --> 00:19:24,570
I'll put in 10,000 yuan, too.

398
00:19:24,710 --> 00:19:25,880
I've got 3,000 yuan.

399
00:19:25,910 --> 00:19:27,240
I-I can put in 5,000 yuan.

400
00:19:27,240 --> 00:19:28,440
I can do 2,800 yuan.

401
00:19:28,540 --> 00:19:29,780
I'll give 3,500 yuan.

402
00:19:29,860 --> 00:19:31,120
I'll put in 2,000. yuan

403
00:19:31,790 --> 00:19:33,250
I've got 50,000 yuan here.

404
00:19:34,230 --> 00:19:35,980
Xiaotao has 30,000 or 40,000 yuan, too.

405
00:19:35,980 --> 00:19:37,110
I've got 6,000 yuan.

406
00:19:38,300 --> 00:19:40,900
But it looks like
we're still pretty far short.

407
00:19:41,440 --> 00:19:42,900
Is there anything else we can do?

408
00:19:42,900 --> 00:19:44,160
We can all help him out.

409
00:19:45,870 --> 00:19:47,830
Actually, summer vacation is coming up.

410
00:19:47,830 --> 00:19:50,090
Lots of places must
be hiring part-timers, right?

411
00:19:50,090 --> 00:19:50,700
Exactly.

412
00:19:51,030 --> 00:19:52,560
We can find jobs that suit us

413
00:19:52,660 --> 00:19:54,260
and at least chip in a little.

414
00:19:54,570 --> 00:19:56,230
We can take on multiple jobs
if we have to.

415
00:19:56,230 --> 00:19:58,160
We'll find a way to raise the money.

416
00:19:58,350 --> 00:19:58,880
Good idea.

417
00:19:58,880 --> 00:20:00,110
-Let's help Sirui out, okay?
-Sure!

418
00:20:00,110 --> 00:20:00,770
-No problem.
-Okay.

419
00:20:00,770 --> 00:20:02,300
-Sounds good.
-No problem.

420
00:20:06,020 --> 00:20:06,600
[Quancheng Ocean and Polar World]

421
00:20:06,600 --> 00:20:07,420
[All Love Park Ocean and Polar World
10th Anniversary Celebration]

422
00:20:07,540 --> 00:20:08,530
[Quancheng All Love Park]

423
00:20:09,180 --> 00:20:10,840
Please take a look. Thank you.

424
00:20:11,400 --> 00:20:12,070
Please take a look.

425
00:20:12,070 --> 00:20:13,310
Our first product

426
00:20:13,310 --> 00:20:14,610
is this all-in-one color-correcting
and contouring cream.

427
00:20:14,610 --> 00:20:16,760
It has a very moist texture.

428
00:20:28,910 --> 00:20:30,020
[All Love Park Animal Kingdom]

429
00:20:34,970 --> 00:20:36,070
Are you sure the pay here

430
00:20:36,070 --> 00:20:37,800
is three times the market rate?

431
00:20:37,880 --> 00:20:38,920
I looked into it.

432
00:20:39,160 --> 00:20:40,070
Giraffe Bistro

433
00:20:40,070 --> 00:20:42,270
is short-staffed
because of the summer vacation, too.

434
00:20:42,270 --> 00:20:44,730
I finally managed
to snag the last two spots.

435
00:20:51,440 --> 00:20:53,100
Excuse me, the check, please.

436
00:20:55,550 --> 00:20:57,150
We'd like the check, please.

437
00:20:57,330 --> 00:20:58,040
Sure. Sure.

438
00:21:06,670 --> 00:21:09,390
Hi. Can I help you with anything?

439
00:21:09,680 --> 00:21:13,340
He's a little scared because
it's his first time seeing a giraffe.

440
00:21:20,460 --> 00:21:21,390
Hey, little one.

441
00:21:21,420 --> 00:21:22,720
Did you know that giraffes

442
00:21:22,720 --> 00:21:24,720
are the kindest animals in the zoo?

443
00:21:32,160 --> 00:21:32,880
Little one.

444
00:21:33,660 --> 00:21:34,920
Giraffes are actually

445
00:21:35,020 --> 00:21:37,610
very cute and very kind.

446
00:21:39,640 --> 00:21:40,570
Once upon a time,

447
00:21:40,880 --> 00:21:42,400
a group of little foxes

448
00:21:43,270 --> 00:21:45,830
were playing hide-and-seek in the forest.

449
00:21:46,240 --> 00:21:48,100
But one of them

450
00:21:48,130 --> 00:21:50,360
accidentally fell into a puddle

451
00:21:50,390 --> 00:21:52,980
and couldn't climb back out,
no matter how hard it tried.

452
00:21:52,980 --> 00:21:53,940
Just then,

453
00:21:54,550 --> 00:21:56,460
a giraffe came along.

454
00:21:58,850 --> 00:22:00,210
That giraffe right there.

455
00:22:00,210 --> 00:22:02,540
It walked over
and looked into the puddle.

456
00:22:02,550 --> 00:22:05,900
Then it stretched its neck down
into the puddle

457
00:22:06,100 --> 00:22:07,560
and said to the little fox,

458
00:22:08,520 --> 00:22:09,920
"Hold on tight to my neck.

459
00:22:10,240 --> 00:22:11,920
The little fox wrapped its paws
around the giraffe's neck,

460
00:22:11,920 --> 00:22:14,460
and the giraffe stood up,

461
00:22:14,480 --> 00:22:16,340
lifting the little fox to safety.

462
00:22:16,830 --> 00:22:19,560
And from then on,
they became the best of friends.

463
00:22:19,590 --> 00:22:21,200
Was that the giraffe
that saved the little fox?

464
00:22:21,200 --> 00:22:22,000
That's right.

465
00:22:22,310 --> 00:22:23,720
Can I feed it?

466
00:22:23,740 --> 00:22:24,870
Of course! Go ahead!

467
00:22:25,000 --> 00:22:25,850
Here you go.

468
00:22:26,960 --> 00:22:27,640
Thank you.

469
00:22:37,500 --> 00:22:38,390
You two

470
00:22:38,410 --> 00:22:40,030
have been doing a great job
these past couple of days.

471
00:22:40,030 --> 00:22:41,060
Thanks for all your hard work.

472
00:22:41,060 --> 00:22:42,990
Thank you. That's very kind of you.

473
00:22:49,640 --> 00:22:51,890
We've been so caught up
in raising money these past few days.

474
00:22:51,890 --> 00:22:53,620
Want to take a break and unwind?

475
00:22:54,290 --> 00:22:54,880
Sure.

476
00:23:33,490 --> 00:23:34,690
Still not answering.

477
00:23:34,800 --> 00:23:36,120
The contract

478
00:23:36,140 --> 00:23:39,070
is clear as day. There's nothing
we can do about that.

479
00:23:39,270 --> 00:23:40,590
But Bai Xue,

480
00:23:40,610 --> 00:23:42,210
as a top agent,

481
00:23:42,240 --> 00:23:44,550
made promises she never intended
to keep and gave him false hope.

482
00:23:44,550 --> 00:23:46,920
People deserve to know about that.

483
00:23:51,830 --> 00:23:53,160
What are you doing here?

484
00:23:54,240 --> 00:23:54,960
Sirui.

485
00:23:55,790 --> 00:23:57,120
We all chipped in

486
00:23:57,240 --> 00:23:58,640
and raised 193,000 yuan.

487
00:23:58,650 --> 00:24:00,250
I just transferred it to you.

488
00:24:06,450 --> 00:24:08,170
I can't accept this much money
from you guys.

489
00:24:08,170 --> 00:24:09,300
Just take it.

490
00:24:10,470 --> 00:24:12,100
This is from everyone on the team

491
00:24:12,100 --> 00:24:15,230
and the girls in our dorm.
It's our way of showing we care.

492
00:24:16,930 --> 00:24:18,530
Come on, just take it for now.

493
00:24:18,950 --> 00:24:20,810
Everyone's doing this out of kindness.

494
00:24:20,810 --> 00:24:23,140
You can pay us back
when you have the money.

495
00:24:27,830 --> 00:24:28,510
I'm sorry.

496
00:24:29,510 --> 00:24:30,200
Gu Han.

497
00:24:36,330 --> 00:24:37,730
Welcome back to the team.

498
00:24:40,660 --> 00:24:41,350
Thank you.

499
00:24:42,520 --> 00:24:43,520
By the way, Sirui,

500
00:24:43,860 --> 00:24:45,720
we're working on a show

501
00:24:45,750 --> 00:24:47,150
and might need your help.

502
00:24:50,240 --> 00:24:52,630
There must be some misunderstanding here.

503
00:24:52,630 --> 00:24:53,490
We're currently

504
00:24:53,490 --> 00:24:54,690
taking legal action

505
00:24:54,730 --> 00:24:56,160
to resolve this matter.

506
00:25:01,150 --> 00:25:01,880
Ms. Bai! Ms. Bai! There's trouble!

507
00:25:01,880 --> 00:25:02,590
Get out!

508
00:25:03,850 --> 00:25:04,750
We can't say

509
00:25:04,380 --> 00:25:06,230
[The Starry Sky]

510
00:25:04,750 --> 00:25:06,200
that certain unscrupulous agents

511
00:25:06,200 --> 00:25:08,400
are hurting young basketball players.

512
00:25:08,400 --> 00:25:10,180
But they sign players under the guise

513
00:25:10,180 --> 00:25:11,310
of being top agents,

514
00:25:11,020 --> 00:25:14,780
[The Starry Sky]

515
00:25:11,400 --> 00:25:12,790
then fail to deliver

516
00:25:12,790 --> 00:25:15,000
on the development plans they promised.

517
00:25:15,000 --> 00:25:17,030
This is typical of Ms. Bai.

518
00:25:17,020 --> 00:25:25,720
[The Starry Sky]

519
00:25:17,110 --> 00:25:18,820
She trades on her reputation
as a top agent

520
00:25:18,820 --> 00:25:19,840
to lure players in with big promises.

521
00:25:19,840 --> 00:25:21,350
She never followed through

522
00:25:21,350 --> 00:25:22,110
on the promised tryouts or variety shows.

523
00:25:22,110 --> 00:25:24,030
In the end, she only promotes
a handful of star players.

524
00:25:24,030 --> 00:25:26,200
She's dishonest with the younger players
she signs,

525
00:25:26,200 --> 00:25:29,730
leaving so many young basketball players
with nowhere to turn.

526
00:25:37,960 --> 00:25:40,060
[Jiangcheng University]

527
00:25:39,900 --> 00:25:40,790
Come on, let's take a picture!

528
00:25:40,140 --> 00:25:41,640
[Best Wishes to the Jiangcheng University
Class of 2019]

529
00:25:40,810 --> 00:25:42,030
Everyone, move up a little.

530
00:25:42,030 --> 00:25:43,590
-Come on, let's take the picture.
-Come on.

531
00:25:43,590 --> 00:25:44,480
Come on, come on. Let's take a picture.

532
00:25:44,480 --> 00:25:45,380
Get in position.

533
00:25:45,380 --> 00:25:45,980
Come on.

534
00:25:46,110 --> 00:25:46,870
-Move in a little.
-Come on/

535
00:25:46,870 --> 00:25:47,660
Sirui,

536
00:25:47,680 --> 00:25:50,790
it's your graduation day. Why are you
standing so far off to the side?

537
00:25:50,790 --> 00:25:52,590
It's fine. I'll just stand here.

538
00:25:52,830 --> 00:25:54,030
Come on, come on!

539
00:25:56,510 --> 00:25:57,510
Front row, crouch down a little.

540
00:25:57,510 --> 00:25:58,960
Okay, look over here.

541
00:25:59,240 --> 00:26:01,110
Three, two, one!

542
00:26:01,110 --> 00:26:03,350
Happy graduation!

543
00:26:03,830 --> 00:26:04,440
Come on!

544
00:26:04,480 --> 00:26:08,110
One, two, three! One, two, three!

545
00:26:04,610 --> 00:26:06,100
[Best Wishes to the Jiangcheng University
Class of 2019]

546
00:26:09,180 --> 00:26:10,330
Captain, your turn.

547
00:26:10,680 --> 00:26:11,730
Captain, come on!

548
00:26:12,000 --> 00:26:14,000
One, two, three!

549
00:26:14,720 --> 00:26:18,720
One, two, three! One, two, three!

550
00:26:21,790 --> 00:26:23,020
Captain, happy graduation!

551
00:26:23,020 --> 00:26:23,720
Happy graduation.

552
00:26:23,720 --> 00:26:25,650
Want to say a few words to everyone?

553
00:26:27,480 --> 00:26:28,200
Well,

554
00:26:29,600 --> 00:26:31,600
today, the two of us are graduating.

555
00:26:32,320 --> 00:26:34,720
From now on, JCU Basketball Team

556
00:26:35,350 --> 00:26:36,280
is in your hands.

557
00:26:38,290 --> 00:26:39,150
Say a few words.

558
00:26:41,150 --> 00:26:42,350
Keep up the good work.

559
00:26:45,500 --> 00:26:46,020
Come on,

560
00:26:46,040 --> 00:26:47,840
let's give them some time alone.

561
00:26:48,090 --> 00:26:49,510
Let's go. Bubble tea's on me!

562
00:26:49,510 --> 00:26:50,110
Let's go.

563
00:26:49,690 --> 00:26:50,610
[Best Wishes to the Jiangcheng University
Class of 2019]

564
00:26:50,350 --> 00:26:51,700
-Captain, happy graduation!
-Bye-bye.

565
00:26:51,700 --> 00:26:52,780
Captain, happy graduation!

566
00:26:52,780 --> 00:26:53,680
Bye! Bye!

567
00:26:53,680 --> 00:26:54,440
-Captain, happy graduation!
-Bye-bye.

568
00:26:54,440 --> 00:26:56,110
-Happy graduation!
-Happy graduation!

569
00:26:54,540 --> 00:26:56,030
[Best Wishes to the Jiangcheng University
Class of 2019]

570
00:26:56,110 --> 00:26:56,960
-Wait for me!
-Bye!

571
00:26:56,960 --> 00:26:58,550
Xiaotao, go ahead.

572
00:27:00,590 --> 00:27:01,480
Go ahead.

573
00:27:03,680 --> 00:27:05,830
Um, let's go take some pictures.

574
00:27:08,400 --> 00:27:09,010
Let's go.

575
00:27:12,010 --> 00:27:13,510
Let's go. Let's take some pictures, too.

576
00:27:13,510 --> 00:27:14,070
Okay.

577
00:27:14,070 --> 00:27:15,780
I'm leaving the captain in your hands.

578
00:27:15,780 --> 00:27:16,380
I'm off.

579
00:27:17,320 --> 00:27:20,980
Sister-in-law, it's your turn
to take a picture with the captain.

580
00:27:21,180 --> 00:27:22,240
Give me a big smile.

581
00:27:22,440 --> 00:27:23,960
Three, two, one.

582
00:27:26,300 --> 00:27:26,900
Great!

583
00:27:28,130 --> 00:27:29,000
Senior Fang Yu.

584
00:27:29,030 --> 00:27:29,760
Xiangxiang.

585
00:27:30,750 --> 00:27:32,210
Happy graduation, Gu Han.

586
00:27:32,240 --> 00:27:33,300
Happy graduation.

587
00:27:34,540 --> 00:27:36,570
How did your interview
at the TV station go?

588
00:27:36,570 --> 00:27:37,680
I just got the news.

589
00:27:38,160 --> 00:27:41,160
I'll be interning on a new show
at the TV station starting next week.

590
00:27:41,160 --> 00:27:41,730
Congratulations.

591
00:27:41,730 --> 00:27:42,710
Congratulations to you, too.

592
00:27:42,710 --> 00:27:45,040
The campus TV station
is in your hands now.

593
00:27:45,190 --> 00:27:45,920
Don't worry.

594
00:27:47,920 --> 00:27:49,580
Want to take a picture with me?

595
00:27:49,810 --> 00:27:50,410
Of course.

596
00:27:51,320 --> 00:27:52,250
You two go ahead.

597
00:27:52,570 --> 00:27:53,170
Kong Fang,

598
00:27:54,330 --> 00:27:54,940
take a picture of them.

599
00:27:54,940 --> 00:27:55,550
Come on.

600
00:27:56,080 --> 00:27:56,670
Come on.

601
00:27:57,410 --> 00:27:58,890
Three, two, one.

602
00:28:00,070 --> 00:28:00,880
Okay.

603
00:28:01,380 --> 00:28:02,110
Senior Fang,

604
00:28:02,400 --> 00:28:04,030
we're taking pictures over there.
We're just waiting for you.

605
00:28:04,030 --> 00:28:05,130
I'll be right there.

606
00:28:05,130 --> 00:28:05,720
Okay.

607
00:28:07,270 --> 00:28:08,750
I'll head over first.

608
00:28:08,880 --> 00:28:10,080
We'll catch up later.

609
00:28:10,850 --> 00:28:11,440
Bye-bye.

610
00:28:11,790 --> 00:28:12,880
-Bye bye.
-Bye bye.

611
00:28:24,590 --> 00:28:26,090
One, two, three!

612
00:28:37,560 --> 00:28:38,190
Thank you.

613
00:28:39,710 --> 00:28:41,240
I was too impulsive before.

614
00:28:42,590 --> 00:28:45,390
I even signed a contract
that banned me from dating

615
00:28:45,940 --> 00:28:48,000
without considering your feelings.

616
00:28:48,830 --> 00:28:49,480
But

617
00:28:49,790 --> 00:28:52,160
you helped me get to the game on time

618
00:28:52,980 --> 00:28:56,310
and even helped me raise the money
to get out of the contract.

619
00:28:56,560 --> 00:28:57,890
It's all in the past now.

620
00:28:58,240 --> 00:29:01,570
It's your graduation day,
so let's take a picture together.

621
00:29:01,960 --> 00:29:03,620
Let's take a photo right here.

622
00:29:03,640 --> 00:29:04,770
-Okay.
-Right here.

623
00:29:10,350 --> 00:29:11,750
Come on, smile.

624
00:29:21,130 --> 00:29:22,860
How is it? Let me see, let me see.

625
00:29:27,350 --> 00:29:29,730
What is this? It's so ugly!

626
00:29:30,070 --> 00:29:31,670
I think it looks pretty good.

627
00:29:53,500 --> 00:29:55,820
♪ What happened? ♪

628
00:29:55,950 --> 00:30:02,960
♪ It seemed like destiny,
but it only backfired ♪

629
00:30:03,850 --> 00:30:06,700
♪ The more we separate,
the closer we'll get ♪

630
00:30:06,830 --> 00:30:10,300
♪ And the more fiercely
my heart will beat ♪

631
00:30:10,730 --> 00:30:14,630
♪ Love is the starry sky
that's waiting for someone ♪

632
00:30:15,270 --> 00:30:17,190
♪ Let's encounter the gentle breeze ♪

633
00:30:18,220 --> 00:30:22,010
♪ Embracing as we reunite ♪

634
00:30:22,230 --> 00:30:24,300
♪ Just like the way we did in the past ♪

635
00:30:24,440 --> 00:30:27,300
♪ The hazy dreams of our youth ♪

636
00:30:27,330 --> 00:30:30,280
♪ Time ebbs and flows, just like a dream ♪

637
00:30:30,300 --> 00:30:33,550
♪ By fate, it's as if ♪

638
00:30:33,940 --> 00:30:36,720
♪ I had been moved by you in every way ♪

639
00:30:33,960 --> 00:30:35,040
Look at the camera.

640
00:30:38,200 --> 00:30:42,380
♪ A gentle breeze sweeps
across the starry sky ♪

641
00:30:42,740 --> 00:30:45,830
♪ The stars embrace the breeze ♪

642
00:30:45,310 --> 00:30:47,240
Three, two, one.

643
00:30:45,950 --> 00:30:50,070
♪ Remember the dreams we chased together ♪

644
00:30:50,330 --> 00:30:51,870
♪ Fearlessly holding on
to what we believe ♪

645
00:30:52,010 --> 00:30:56,550
♪ Through every twist
and turn of our story ♪

646
00:30:56,580 --> 00:31:01,040
♪ Our eyes are filled
with the happiest tales to tell ♪

647
00:31:01,350 --> 00:31:05,680
♪ Love is like two hearts intertwined ♪

648
00:31:07,300 --> 00:31:10,420
♪ Binding you and me together ♪

649
00:31:07,670 --> 00:31:08,620
Smile.

650
00:31:17,820 --> 00:31:18,980
This one's good.

651
00:31:24,050 --> 00:31:25,470
We've spent the whole day taking pictures

652
00:31:25,470 --> 00:31:26,730
and watching everyone be lovey-dovey.

653
00:31:26,730 --> 00:31:27,770
I'm sick of it.

654
00:31:28,240 --> 00:31:29,480
Tell me about it.

655
00:31:32,690 --> 00:31:33,790
Look at this one.

656
00:31:35,240 --> 00:31:36,360
This one's great.

657
00:31:48,090 --> 00:31:48,950
Are you hungry?

658
00:31:50,050 --> 00:31:51,780
Have a little something to eat.

659
00:31:52,160 --> 00:31:52,920
Thanks.

660
00:32:04,880 --> 00:32:06,940
Honestly, these people are too much.

661
00:32:07,200 --> 00:32:09,260
Every single one of them is paired up.

662
00:32:09,260 --> 00:32:11,460
We're the only ones here who are single.

663
00:32:12,000 --> 00:32:13,720
I... I...

664
00:32:16,750 --> 00:32:18,440
Hey, babe.

665
00:32:18,960 --> 00:32:20,930
I'm helping them take graduation photos.

666
00:32:20,930 --> 00:32:24,390
Yeah, Xiangxiang and Xiaotao
are here with their boyfriends.

667
00:32:24,750 --> 00:32:26,750
The pictures are turning out great.

668
00:32:27,340 --> 00:32:29,050
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

669
00:32:30,270 --> 00:32:34,120
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

670
00:32:32,500 --> 00:32:34,460
Babe, happy graduation!

671
00:32:34,790 --> 00:32:35,500
Sister-in-law,

672
00:32:35,500 --> 00:32:36,680
can we borrow the captain for a bit?

673
00:32:36,680 --> 00:32:37,290
Sure.

674
00:32:37,320 --> 00:32:38,250
That looks good.

675
00:32:38,380 --> 00:32:39,550
-Come on, let's take a picture.
-Sirui.

676
00:32:39,550 --> 00:32:41,350
Come on, let's get a group photo!

677
00:32:41,790 --> 00:32:42,550
Oh, stop it!

678
00:32:45,780 --> 00:32:46,380
Come on!

679
00:32:50,570 --> 00:32:51,640
Everyone, everyone,

680
00:32:51,640 --> 00:32:52,400
sorry I'm late.

681
00:32:52,400 --> 00:32:53,720
-Tian.
-Tian.

682
00:32:54,200 --> 00:32:56,460
There's something I need to tell you all.

683
00:32:56,830 --> 00:32:58,610
Huidong Team,

684
00:32:58,640 --> 00:33:00,100
the pro league champions,

685
00:33:00,130 --> 00:33:02,050
is preparing for the preseason.

686
00:33:02,080 --> 00:33:03,960
They want to invite our team

687
00:33:04,240 --> 00:33:06,000
to play a game against them.

688
00:33:07,280 --> 00:33:08,460
Here's the invitation.

689
00:33:07,480 --> 00:33:08,100
[2019 Preseason Invitation]

690
00:33:08,750 --> 00:33:11,290
Huidong Team, ten-time champions
of the pro league!

691
00:33:11,290 --> 00:33:12,940
-That's right.
-I've watched them play since I was a kid.

692
00:33:12,650 --> 00:33:13,460
[Invitation]

693
00:33:13,240 --> 00:33:16,300
I never thought
I'd get the chance to play against them.

694
00:33:16,440 --> 00:33:17,640
Let me see. Let me see.

695
00:33:18,850 --> 00:33:19,880
All right, all right.

696
00:33:19,880 --> 00:33:20,790
Careful, don't tear it!

697
00:33:20,790 --> 00:33:22,880
You two,
make sure you're well prepared.

698
00:33:22,880 --> 00:33:24,480
This is your last game

699
00:33:24,480 --> 00:33:25,510
as college players.

700
00:33:25,510 --> 00:33:26,970
-No problem.
-No problem.

701
00:33:27,400 --> 00:33:28,650
Since some of us are graduating,

702
00:33:28,650 --> 00:33:30,210
let's take a group photo!

703
00:33:30,250 --> 00:33:31,370
Sounds good. Come on.

704
00:33:31,370 --> 00:33:31,980
Come on.

705
00:33:32,610 --> 00:33:33,540
Find your spots.

706
00:33:34,750 --> 00:33:35,680
Sister-in-law.

707
00:33:36,230 --> 00:33:38,230
Come on, everyone, get in position.

708
00:33:38,230 --> 00:33:39,160
Sister-in-law.

709
00:33:39,370 --> 00:33:41,430
Everyone, move closer to the middle.

710
00:33:42,160 --> 00:33:42,760
That's it.

711
00:33:43,240 --> 00:33:44,020
Everyone, smile!

712
00:33:44,020 --> 00:33:45,100
Look at the camera.

713
00:33:46,640 --> 00:33:49,070
Three, two—

714
00:33:49,310 --> 00:33:49,980
Auntie!

715
00:33:50,680 --> 00:33:51,920
Hello, Xiangxiang.

716
00:33:51,940 --> 00:33:52,590
Ms. Wan.

717
00:33:52,800 --> 00:33:53,790
-Hello, Ms. Wan.
-Hi, everyone.

718
00:33:53,790 --> 00:33:54,840
-Hello, Ms. Wan.
-Hello, Ms. Wan.

719
00:33:54,840 --> 00:33:55,930
-Hello, Ms. Wan.
-Hello, Ms. Wan.

720
00:33:55,930 --> 00:33:56,540
Mom.

721
00:33:57,850 --> 00:33:59,870
Happy graduation, son.

722
00:34:00,020 --> 00:34:00,700
Thank you.

723
00:34:01,880 --> 00:34:03,870
Auntie, let's take a group photo
together!

724
00:34:03,870 --> 00:34:05,400
-Come on.
-Let's all get in.

725
00:34:07,090 --> 00:34:08,280
Happy graduation.

726
00:34:10,040 --> 00:34:11,370
Xiangxiang, come here.

727
00:34:12,080 --> 00:34:13,409
You stand in the middle.

728
00:34:16,179 --> 00:34:17,840
All right, get ready. Come on.

729
00:34:18,800 --> 00:34:19,400
Come on.

730
00:34:21,000 --> 00:34:22,420
Move a little closer this way.

731
00:34:22,420 --> 00:34:23,620
That's it, that's it.

732
00:34:23,920 --> 00:34:25,179
Okay, everyone ready?

733
00:34:25,909 --> 00:34:27,179
Look over here. Ready?

734
00:34:27,210 --> 00:34:29,330
Three, two, one!

735
00:34:29,400 --> 00:34:30,690
Cheese!
